1.Start Application
The user opens the EcoArmor web application using Streamlit.

2.Theme & Language Selection
The user selects the preferred theme (Light/Dark) and language from the options provided.

3.User Input Collection
i.The user enters coastal parameters:

ii.Average wave height

iii.Cyclone frequency

iv.Coastal soil type

v.Environmental priority

4.Data Processing
The system converts user inputs into numeric values and percentage scores for analysis.

5.Decision Logic Execution
Based on predefined rules and conditions, the system selects the most suitable eco-friendly armor unit.

6.Recommendation Generation
The system generates:

Armor unit recommendation

Explanation for selection

7.Visualization
